## Moat vs OSS

New **proprietary** Space-Time product work that is not already on a public remote → **moat** (`src/moat/`, gitignored roadmaps / memory-bank). Do not dump unreleased IP into tracked public `src/` “for convenience.” OSS shell stays attribution-clean; moat stays unpublished. Public **Avatar Role** schema (`docs/AVATAR_ROLE.md`) is intentional OSS for marketplace portability.
